## ✅ Completely safe (mechanical, behavior-preserving)

### 1. static-components → delete one dead file (11 warnings, 1 action)
`packages/domains/ai-config/src/client/LayoutPreviews.tsx` is orphaned (verified: nothing imports it,
not in barrel, header says "not connected to any real handlers"). Delete it → all 11 gone. Already
covered by subtask `152bcd71`.

### 2. refs — "latest-value mirror" writes (~38, the big safe win)
Pattern: `xRef.current = x` written during render, ref READ only inside effects / async / event
callbacks. Fix = move the write into `useEffect(() => { xRef.current = x })`. Behavior-preserving
because no consumer reads it during render.
Representative files: `editor/use-editor-setup.ts` (onSave/onChange/onBlur/onReady… callback mirrors),
`file-editor/useWatchedFile.ts`, `editor/use-artifact-upload.ts`, `chat/autocomplete/useAutocomplete.ts`,
`chat/useChatQueue.ts`, `terminal/useLoopMode.ts`, `ui/use-document-visibility.ts`, `ui/use-stable-poll.ts`,
`ui/useShortcutAction.ts`, `LoadingScreen.tsx`, `task-browser/DeviceWebview.tsx`,
`task-browser/useBrowserView.ts` / `useBrowserViewEvents.ts`, `worktrees/git-diff-store.ts` (keyRef),
`worktrees/useConsolidatedGeneralData.ts`.

### 3. set-state clamps / derived resets (~2)
`chat/useChatSearch.ts` (clamp activeIdx to match-count) and `editor/ArtifactPicker.tsx` (reset index
on query) → compute during render instead of effect.

### 4. immutability — test prop rename (~3)
`markdown/usePanZoom.test.tsx` out-param refs flagged; rename props to end in `*Ref`. Borderline
(multi-site rename) — verify call sites.

## ⛔ NOT safe — do NOT bulk-fix
- **set-state-in-effect (~154):** async IPC fetches (`await window.api…→setState`), event/IPC
  subscriptions, intentional auto-navigation (git panel tab auto-switch), form-draft resets seeded
  from props, DOM measurement, debounce timers, exit-animation lifecycles. Each needs per-site
  redesign or a justified `eslint-disable`. This is where the risk lives.
- **refs (~20):** render-time ref READS feeding JSX (rich-text-editor ArtifactPicker gate,
  TerminalSplitGroup xterm/chat handle refs), rAF / WebContentsView bounds-sync, `useSyncExternalStore`
  stable identity, lazy-init singletons (`use-undo`), DOM-measure fit math.
- **purity (5):** relative-time `Date.now()` (pulling out of render stales the displayed age),
  `Math.random()` skeleton width in `useMemo([])` (load-bearing stable width). All need a tick/lazy-init.
- **preserve-manual-memoization (2):** git-diff-store `useSyncExternalStore` — intentional, leave.

## Recommendation
